I’m hiring! If you: 

✨Come from the legal world (you don’t need to have been a lawyer, but you’ve worked closely with them) and understand how lawyers work, both in law firms and in-house; 
✨Want to work at the forefront of legal tech, across AI, legal research, contract automation and legal workflow; 
✨Understand (and can explain) how large language models and agents actually work, and where they fit into legal workflows; 
✨Enjoy working with, and occasionally geeking out with, customers; 
✨Can tell a good story, whether that’s in a demo, on a stage or in an RFP response; 
✨Don’t mind getting stuck in with the sales team to get a deal over the line; 
✨Enjoy building and tinkering with AI tools (bonus points if you’ve built something you’re slightly too proud of); 
✨Speak fluent Mandarin, as you’ll be supporting customers in China (Cantonese is a bonus); 
✨Are based in Hong Kong or Singapore (preferably Hong Kong); and 
✨Are just a cool person all around,

please apply to join my team here: https://lnkd.in/gPRTbreA 

I can’t guarantee that you’ll be rescuing customers from perilous snowstorms in the mountains though.

We are also hiring for BDM/AE and CSM roles, so please do reach out if interested.

#LegalTech #LegalAI #Hiring #Singapore #HongKong
